     * total formatted with those decimals — matching the CCTP v2 provider. The
     * `quote` envelope stays RAW (`signedQuote`, `totalAmount`, `items[].amount`
     * are the exact on-chain integers); only the summary is formatted. Gas-fee
     * estimation is left empty (CCTPx fees are quote-driven, not per-step gas at
     * estimate time).
     *
     * @param params - The bridge parameters; `token` is a {@link CCTPXRouteToken}
     *   — a {@link KnownTokenSymbol} or a bytes32 {@link CCTPXTokenId},
     *   resolved to the canonical id internally.
