     *   `source` and `destination` resolve to the same CCTP domain, or when
     *   either endpoint has no CCTPx deployment; `INPUT_NETWORK_MISMATCH` (`FATAL`) when they are
     *   on different networks; `INPUT_INVALID_CHAIN` (`FATAL`) when either
     *   endpoint has no CCTP domain; or a re-thrown inner `KitError` from the
     *   quote fetch.
     *
     * @example
     * ```typescript
     * const estimate = await provider.estimate(params)
     * console.log(estimate.quote?.totalAmount, estimate.fees[0]?.token)
     * ```
